<ans># ManipalCigna Health Insurance — Q1FY25 (Quarter Ended 30 June 2024) Financial Data

## Research Summary

I directly opened and read the two documents specified:

1. **ManipalCigna Annual Report FY2024-25** — the full-year audited financial statements (FY ended 31 March 2025, with FY23-24 comparatives)
2. **ManipalCigna Financial Disclosures page** (manipalcigna.com/disclosures/financial-disclosures) — this page hosts **only Annual Reports** (FY2012-13 through FY2024-25); it does **not** carry quarterly IRDAI "NL" public-disclosure PDFs

I also ran multiple targeted searches specifically for a Q1FY25 investor presentation or standalone quarterly NL-1/NL-2 disclosure PDF (quarter ended 30 June 2024). None could be located. ManipalCigna, being debt-listed only (not equity-listed), does not appear to publish a quarterly investor deck in the manner of listed peers such as Star Health or Niva Bupa, and no standalone quarterly NL disclosure PDF for June 2024 was found on the company's website or via web search.

One CARE Ratings rationale surfaced a solvency figure, but it was reported **as of 30 September 2024 (H1FY25/Q2FY25 cumulative)** — not the 30 June 2024 (Q1FY25) period required — so per the task's strict period-matching rule it cannot be used here.

**Conclusion:** No Q1FY25-specific (quarter ended 30 June 2024) statutory or investor-deck figures were found published in the specified sources or through search. Consistent with the instruction to leave genuinely unpublished figures blank rather than estimate them, all value cells are blank.

