## Recommendation

To obtain genuine Q1FY25 (quarter ended 30 June 2024) figures, the actual IRDAI quarterly "NL" disclosure PDF for that period would need to be located either directly on the IRDAI portal or on a ManipalCigna webpage/section not surfaced by the searches conducted here. No such document was discoverable within the two documents specified in this task or via subsequent web searches. If you have access to an alternate URL (e.g., a dedicated "quarterly disclosures" or "public disclosures" archive distinct from the Annual Reports page), sharing it would allow this data to be extracted directly.</ans>
